l Booker Prize Shortlist\\nauthor: Geetanjali Shree; Daisy Rockwell\\ndate: 2022-06-24\\n---\\nThe International Booker Prize celebrates the best fiction in translation published over the previous year. Frank Wynne, acclaimed translator and chair of the 2022 judging panel, tells Five Books about the six novels ... \",\"title\":\"https://fivebooks.com/best-books/the-best-of-world-literature-the-2022-international-booker-prize-shortlist-frank-wynne/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Oz was a writer and journalist whose work has been translated into over forty languages. His last novel, Judas, was shortlisted for the Booker Prize in 2017 and won the Yasnaya Polyana Foreign Fiction Award. He received several international awards, including the Prix Femina, the Israel Prize, the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"3bce73865f00522ea52ffb9f737c59480f7e6f1936cb39c051b1b42a212ec194\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"dddd1ce3bb49a89db930b97c8f0b8042d4edf5f07acd8bc72bba08c237f30854\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"translated into over twenty five languages novel International Booker contender\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_e577a3f7fa0f4c41a3801fb6"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... winner Han Kang was eligible for this year's prize with her b